  "sentence": {
    "text": "You may get caught up in all kinds of thoughts, abstract ions. But sooner or later you notice. You notice. Because fundamentally, the awareness that is the ground of your experience is more potent, more inherent than all the little thoughts that pull you around in different directions. So really use the moment of noticing. It's not so much that, oh, I wasn't aware and now I am aware. But rather the fact that, oh, awareness has shown itself, has shone through my little preoccupation. And then to just let yourself be recalled to awareness. Letting yourself rest. to awareness.",
